:''Intimidate your rivals by donning the imposing Dovah's Du'ul armor style, dropped in Pelinal Boon Boxes.''{{Ref|name=Web|[https://www.elderscrollsonline.com/en-us/news/post/65535 Conquer the Battlefield & Earn a New Style During the Whitestrake's Mayhem PvP Event - Website]}}
The '''Dovah's Du'ul Style''' is an outfit style inspired by the [[ON:Nord|Nordic]] [[ON:Dragon Cult|dragon warriors]]. It cannot be crafted, and is only available as part of the [[ON:Outfit System|Outfit System]]. Pieces are in [[ON:Heavy Armor|Heavy Armor]] only.

Pages were first made obtainable during the [[Online:Whitestrake's Mayhem|Whitestrake's Mayhem]] event in February–March 2024. The style pages were brought back to [[Online:The Impresario|The Impresario]]'s store with the Whitestrake's Mayhem August 2026 event.

==Style Pages==
* Armor pages have a chance to drop from [[ON:Pelinal's Midyear Boon Box|Pelinal's Midyear Boon Box]]es available during the event. 
* Style pages can also be bought from [[Online:The Impresario|The Impresario]] for {{ESO TB|200}} each; however, these are account-bound and cannot be sold or traded. They were originally sold for {{ESO ET|5}}.
